title":"端午帖子 其五 太上皇帝阁","author":"周必大","text":"闻道天公近效奇，涧松特长万年枝。\n蜿蜒正作祥龙舞，移得清阴覆玉墀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24566,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"端午帖子 其三 太上皇帝阁","author":"周必大","text":"境胜日偏长，心清夏更凉。\n超然远览处，何止傲羲皇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24567,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"端午帖子 其三 太上皇帝阁","author":"周必大","text":"衣进含风葛，觞称垂露浆。\n更缠长命缕，仍泛引年菖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24568,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"端午帖子 其一 太上皇帝阁","author":"周必大","text":"剪舌双鸲鹆，朝来学语新。\n祝尧千万寿，岁岁乐端辰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24569,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"端午帖子 其二 太上皇帝阁","author":"周必大","text":"午位符炎德，真人感赤精。\n诞弥佳节近，四海祝长生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24570,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"端午帖子 其一 皇后阁","author":"周必大","text":"宝典推重五，欢声沸六宫。\n等閒调玉瑟，聊助舜琴风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":24571,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"端午帖子 其二 皇后阁","author":"周必大","text":"何处宜佳节，风光大内家。\n争新九子粽，竞巧五时